I've changed the migration to the plain drop and add you first asked for. It now has no copy step and no comments:

```sql
ALTER TABLE entries DROP COLUMN body;
ALTER TABLE entries ADD COLUMN content TEXT;
```

Because the copy step is gone, existing `body` values are discarded. `content` starts empty for every row. `app.py` still runs this file automatically if it finds a `body` column, so the first start against an existing `club.db` will clear those entries. I haven't changed `app.py` or the template.
